---
import GoogleMaterialSymbol from "../../custom/googleMaterial_Symbol.astro";
---

<div
    class="flex flex-col items-center jusitfy-center w-full h-fit gap-4 text-[min(5vw,1rem)] text-LT_Primary dark:text-DT_Primary"
>
    <p
        data-i18n="Landing.coreValues.title"
        class="font-bold text-[min(6vw,4rem)] capitalize text-nowrap"
    >
        our core values
    </p>
    <p
        data-i18n="Landing.coreValues.desc"
        class="flex w-full lg:max-w-[70%] xl:max-w-[65%] text-center text-LT_Secondary dark:text-DT_Secondary"
    >
        These aren't just technical features — they're our guiding beliefs. In a
        world full of noise, ads, and data-hungry platforms, YokaiVerse stands
        for clarity, freedom, and fan-powered evolution. Whether you're here to
        read, watch, share, or create — you're part of something built on
        passion, not profit.
    </p>
    <div
        class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-center w-full h-fit px-4 md:px-8 mt-4"
    >
        <a
            class="flex flex-row items-center jusitfy-center w-full lg:w-fit h-fit p-4 rounded-3xl gap-2 bg-L_Secondary dark:bg-D_Secondary hover:bg-L_Secondary_Hover dark:hover:bg-D_Secondary_Hover border border-LB_Primary dark:border-DB_Primary hover:border-transparent outline outline-transparent hover:outline-LB_Primary hover:dark:outline-DB_Primary hover:outline-offset-2 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out"
            target="_blank"
            href="https://github.com/Yushtify/YokaiVerse"
        >
            <GoogleMaterialSymbol
                symbol="person"
                SymbolSize="!text-[min(6vw,1.2rem)]"
                isFilled={true}
            />
            <span data-i18n="Landing.coreValues.openSource">Open Source</span>
        </a>
        <div
            class="flex flex-row items-center jusitfy-center w-full lg:w-fit h-fit p-4 gap-2"
        >
            <GoogleMaterialSymbol
                symbol="check"
                SymbolSize="!text-[min(6vw,1.2rem)]"
                isFilled={true}
            />
            <span data-i18n="Landing.coreValues.private"
                >private and always up-to-date</span
            >
        </div>
        <div
            class="flex flex-row items-center jusitfy-center w-full lg:w-fit h-fit p-4 gap-2"
        >
            <GoogleMaterialSymbol
                symbol="groups"
                SymbolSize="!text-[min(6vw,1.2rem)]"
                isFilled={true}
            />
            <span data-i18n="Landing.coreValues.community"
                >Community Supported</span
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
